    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Reid & Coppinger are delighted to bring to the market this spacious five-bedroomed detached two storey family home on a c. 46 acre site with stunning views of the River Suir . The property is only a fifteen minute drive from Waterford City and a thirty minute drive to Kilkenny. The property is entered by a large sweeping tarmacadam driveway surrounded by mature gardens and shrubbery. This family home is situated on an elevated site with magnificent countryside overland views and of the River Suir. Accommodation comprises of entrance porch, hallway, livingroom, sitting room / dining room, sun room, kitchen /diner, bedroom and shower room. First floor comprises of four spacious bedrooms with main en suite , bathrrom and longe room. This spacious home is spanning a total floor area of 235 sq.mt. The property has the benefit of of a detached garage and two stables. Viewing is highly recommended.\n\nLOCATION\nThe property is located just a ten minute drive from Waterford city centre with easy access to the N24 makes Carrick on Suir and Clonmel easily accessible. Nearby primary schools include Carrigeen, Mooncoin, Dunkitt, Kilmacow and Ferrybank. Convenient Secondary schools include Mooncoin, Ferrybank and a host of schooling options in Waterford City. \nOther local amenities include GAA clubs,Carrigeen, Kilmacow & Mooncoin, Carrigeen Soccer Club, pre-school childcare and a shop, pub, community centre and church in Carrigeen village.\nwith the convenience of both a primary and secondary schools and all essential local amenities within a few minutes drive.\n\nGARDEN\nTo the front garden there is a large tarmacadam driveway surrounded by mature lawns and shrubbery.\nThe rear garden has mature lawned gardens and shrubbery with stables and garage.\n\nASKING PRICE 445,000\n\nFor further information and viewing arrangements please contact DNG Reid & Coppinger 051-852233."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 2.98 x 3.26\nTiled flooring.\n\nEntrance Hall - 1.37 x 2.88\nCarpet flooring.\n\nLiving Room/Dining Room - 3.61 x 8.02\nCarpet flooring. Blinds and curtains to windows. Marble open fireplace with double doors to patio area.\n\nSitting Room - 6.10 x 3.03\nSolid timber flooring. Granite fireplace with Stanley wood-burning stove. Curtains to window.\n\nKitchen / Diner - 5.87 x 2.78\nSolid timber flooring. Fitted kitchen with granite worktops. Integrated oven and hob.\n\nSun Room - 4.05 x 2.73\nTiled flooring. Vaulted ceiling. Door to patio and garden.\n\nShower Room - 2.28 x 2.61\nTiled flooring and walls to ceiling. WC, WHB, corner shower.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 2.92 x 4.38\nCarpet flooring. Blinds and curtains to windows. Fitted wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.44 x 2.13\nCarpet flooring. WC, WHB, shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.02 x 3.79\nSolid timber flooring. Blinds and curtains to windows.\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - \n\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.50 x 2.52\nCarpet flooring. Curtains to window.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.04 x 2.97\nCarpet flooring. Fitted wardrobes. Curtains and blinds to window.\n\nBedroom 5 - 2.88 x 3.02\nCarpet flooring. Fitted wardrobes. Blinds to windows.\n\nLounge Room - 3.00 x 3.31\nCarpet flooring. Blinds to window.\n\nShower Room - 1.81 x 2.25\nTiled flooring and walls to ceiling. WC, WHB, corner shower with glass doors.\n\n"
      },
